sequenceDiagram
    participant VLLM as vLLM pod<br/>ZMQ PUB 5557/TCP
    participant EPP as EPP scheduler<br/>kvcache.Indexer (in-process)
    participant Tok as UDS tokenizer sidecar<br/>unix socket, gRPC
    participant HF as Hugging Face Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Idx as kvblock.Index<br/>in-memory or Redis 6379/TCP
    participant PVC as Shared KV-cache PVC<br/>/kv-cache
    participant Ev as PVC evictor<br/>Go Deployment

    Note over VLLM,Idx: Flow 2 - KV event ingestion (write path)
    VLLM->>EPP: KVEvents BlockStored/BlockRemoved<br/>ZMTP, msgpack, topic kv@...<br/>No encryption, no auth
    EPP->>Idx: Update index (FNV-32a sharded worker)<br/>in-process or RESP, TLS only if rediss://

    Note over EPP,Idx: Flow 1 - Precise prefix-cache scoring (read path)
    EPP->>Tok: Tokenize / RenderChatCompletion<br/>gRPC over UDS, insecure, pod-local
    opt First use of a model (InitializeTokenizer)
        Tok->>HF: Download tokenizer files<br/>HTTPS TLS, optional HF_TOKEN
        HF-->>Tok: tokenizer/config files (trust_remote_code=True)
    end
    Tok-->>EPP: token IDs (+ offsets / mm features)
    EPP->>EPP: Hash tokens to block keys<br/>FNV-64a + canonical CBOR
    EPP->>Idx: Lookup block keys for candidate pods
    Idx-->>EPP: pods holding blocks
    EPP->>EPP: GetPodScores returns prefix-hit scores

    Note over VLLM,Ev: Flow 3 - PVC eviction (off request path)
    VLLM->>PVC: Write offloaded .bin blocks<br/>POSIX FS, UID/fsGroup
    loop every 0.5 s
        Ev->>PVC: statfs (usage %)
    end
    alt usage above 85%
        Ev->>PVC: crawl, stat atime, unlink cold .bin until 70%
        opt STORAGE_EVENTS_ENDPOINT set
            Ev-)EPP: BlockRemoved, ZMTP PUB<br/>topic kv@SHARED_STORAGE@model<br/>No CURVE auth
        end
    end
